# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local `wrangler dev` (gitignored — never commit real values).
# svcldb-solve reaches Supabase with the PUBLIC anon key (in wrangler.toml [vars]) +
# these two secrets. No OpenRouter key and no service_role key are needed here.
SVC_METERING_SECRET=...gates the credit RPCs; sha256 hash stored in svc_config...
RELAY_SECRET=...matches SVC_RELAY_SECRET on openrouter-proxy (X-Svc-Relay relay branch)...
